---
const services = [
  { name: "Drive", description: "登录后确认文件、容量和账户权限，再配置同步客户端。", href: "https://drive.maximoraverse.org/login", guide: "drive-guide" },
  { name: "Network", description: "先核对套餐、到期时间与设备限制，再导入自己的订阅。", href: "https://proxyservice.maximoraverse.org/login", guide: "network-guide" },
  { name: "DNS", description: "在原账户页查看状态并复制个人地址，按设备完成配置。", href: "https://dns.maximoraverse.org/login", guide: "dns-guide" },
  { name: "Mirrors", description: "先浏览公开项目，需要登录或授权时按项目要求确认。", href: "https://mirrors.maximoraverse.org/", guide: "mirrors-user" },
];
const docsUrl = "https://docs.maximoraverse.org";

---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head>
	<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width">
	<meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f7fa" media="(prefers-color-scheme:light)"><meta name="theme-color" content="#090a0c" media="(prefers-color-scheme:dark)">
	<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png"><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand-icon.css?v=1">
	<title>MatchAll Console · 统一服务控制台</title><meta name="description" content="统一查看 MatchAll 服务、通知与账户连接状态。"><link rel="canonical" href="https://console.maximoraverse.org/">
	<meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:site_name" content="MatchAll"><meta property="og:title" content="MatchAll Console · 统一服务控制台"><meta property="og:description" content="集中查看服务状态、账户连接与通知偏好。"><meta property="og:url" content="https://console.maximoraverse.org/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.maximoraverse.org/assets/brand/matchall-social-1200x630.png"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
	<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebApplication","name":"MatchAll Console","url":"https://console.maximoraverse.org/","applicationCategory":"BusinessApplication","operatingSystem":"Web"}</script>
	<style>
		:root{color-scheme:light dark;--bg:#f6f7fa;--card:#fff;--text:#171a21;--muted:#697180;--line:#dce1e8;--accent:#2563eb}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:16px/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0,#dbeafe,transparent 35%),var(--bg);color:var(--text)}main{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:24px}.skip{position:fixed;left:1rem;top:1rem;z-index:999;transform:translateY(-200%);padding:.7rem 1rem;border-radius:.7rem;background:var(--text);color:var(--bg)}.skip:focus{transform:none}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}.nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px}.brand{font-weight:800}.hero{padding:14vh 0 8vh;max-width:760px}h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,8vw,5.5rem);line-height:1;margin:.2em 0}.lead{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--muted)}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}.btn{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:.8rem 1.1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;background:var(--card)}.primary{background:var(--text);color:var(--bg)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px}.card{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--card) 88%,transparent)}.card p{color:var(--muted)}.steps{padding-left:1.5rem}.steps li{margin:1.2rem 0}.steps p{color:var(--muted);margin:.3rem 0}.section{margin-top:48px}.card .actions{margin-top:16px}.section h2{font-size:1.8rem}.nav-links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}footer{padding:60px 0 24px;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding-top:10vh}}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#090a0c;--card:#111318;--text:#f4f5f7;--muted:#9ba3b0;--line:#272b33;--accent:#60a5fa}body{background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0,#172554,transparent 35%),var(--bg)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
	</style>
</head>
<body><a class="skip" href="#main">跳到正文</a>
<main id="main">
  <nav class="nav" aria-label="主导航"><span class="brand"><img src="/icon-192.png" width="36" height="36" alt="">MatchAll Console</span><div class="nav-links"><a class="btn" href={`${docsUrl}/`}>文档中心</a><a class="btn" href="https://www.maximoraverse.org/">全部服务</a></div></nav>
  <section class="hero"><small>UNIFIED SERVICE CONSOLE</small><h1>从登录，到第一次使用。</h1><p class="lead">统一账户负责登录，各业务分别管理权限。Console 提供只读汇总与服务入口，不代替开通、购买或设备配置。</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/login">登录并进入控制台</a><a class="btn" href="/console">已有会话，直接进入</a><a class="btn" href={`${docsUrl}/docs/getting-started/`}>完整入门指南</a></div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="start-title"><h2 id="start-title">第一次使用，按这三步走</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><strong>准备统一账户</strong><p>已有账户直接登录。新用户需要有效邀请，按注册页完成校验与邮箱验证。</p><a href="https://auth.maximoraverse.org/register">使用邀请码注册 →</a> · <a href="https://www.maximoraverse.org/contact/">没有邀请？查看联系渠道</a></li>
      <li><strong>选择需要的服务</strong><p>进入下方原服务确认权限。注册成功不代表套餐、软件授权或 DNS 过滤已经开通。</p></li>
      <li><strong>完成首次使用，再核对汇总</strong><p>按对应指南完成文件访问、客户端连接或设备配置。回到 Console 时留意快照时间；原服务数据优先，刷新页面不会触发同步。</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="service-title"><h2 id="service-title">直接进入原服务</h2><div class="grid">{services.map((service) => <article class="card"><h3>MatchAll {service.name}</h3><p>{service.description}</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href={service.href}>进入 {service.name}</a><a class="btn" href={`${docsUrl}/docs/${service.guide}/`}>使用指南</a></div></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="help-title"><h2 id="help-title">中断后也能继续</h2><p class="lead">取消登录或会话过期后，从登录入口重新开始。服务异常先看状态页；不要重复提交旧回调或反复创建账户。</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="https://status.maximoraverse.org/">服务状态</a><a class="btn" href={`${docsUrl}/docs/troubleshooting/`}>常见问题排查</a></div></section>
  <footer>© 2026 MatchAll · Console</footer>
</main></body></html>
